<title>RUSSIA: TABLE-Russia inflation quickens to 0.2 pct in week.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Russia inflation quickens to 0.2 pct in week.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Russian inflation is estimated to have accelerated in the week ended July 14 to 0.2 percent from 0.1 percent in the previous week, the State Statistics Committee said on Thursday.</p>
<p>The committee issued the following inflation estimates:</p>
<p>    Percentage change in week ended	   July 14    July 7</p>
<p>    Consumer prices (total)			  +0.2	+0.1</p>
<p>    Average daily inflation		    July 1-14 June 1-30</p>
<p>    Consumer prices (total)			 +0.023    +0.036</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
